    "The Adhan reminder fires this many minutes before the jamaat time set below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ينطلق تذكير الأذان قبل وقت الجماعة المحدد أدناه بهذا العدد من الدقائق."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "নিচে নির্ধারিত জামাতের সময়ের এত মিনিট আগে আজানের রিমাইন্ডার বাজবে।"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ezan hatırlatıcısı, aşağıda ayarlanan cemaat vaktinden bu kadar dakika önce çalar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Times as announced by your mosque. The Adhan chip is the jamaat time minus the offset above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الأوقات كما يعلنها مسجدك. ملصق الأذان هو وقت الجماعة مطروحاً منه الإزاحة أعلاه."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "আপনার মসজিদের ঘোষণা অনুযায়ী সময়। আজানের চিপ হলো জামাতের সময় থেকে উপরের অফসেট বাদ দেওয়া।"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caminizin duyurduğu vakitler. Ezan etiketi, cemaat vaktinden yukarıdaki farkın çıkarılmasıdır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Prayer Times": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مرحباً بك في أوقات الصلاة"
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "প্রেয়ার টাইমসে স্বাগতম"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prayer Times'a hoş geldiniz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let's set things up in a few quick steps. You can change any of this later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لنُعِدّ التطبيق في بضع خطوات سريعة. يمكنك تغيير أيٍّ من ذلك لاحقاً من الإعدادات."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "চলুন কয়েকটি দ্রুত ধাপে সেট আপ করি। পরে সেটিংস থেকে যেকোনো কিছু পরিবর্তন করতে পারবেন।"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Birkaç hızlı adımda kuralım. Bunların tümünü daha sonra Ayarlar'dan değiştirebilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accurate times for your exact location": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أوقات دقيقة لموقعك بالضبط"
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "আপনার সঠিক অবস্থানের নির্ভুল সময়"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tam konumunuz için doğru vakitler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications and the Adhan, your way": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الإشعارات والأذان كما تريد"
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "নোটিফিকেশন ও আজান, আপনার পছন্দমতো"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bildirimler ve ezan, sizin tarzınızda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focus Mode to pause and pray": {
      "localizations": {
